{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-with-hilt","title":"Hilt 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/testing-with-hilt","wordCount":618,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"hilt-测试\">Hilt 测试</h1><p>Hilt 提供了完善的测试支持，允许在测试中替换绑定、卸载模块以及创建自定义测试组件。正确配置 Hilt 测试环境是编写可靠 Android 测试的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hilt 测试围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code> + <code>HiltAndroidRule</code></strong>：启用测试类中的依赖注入，<code>hiltRule.inject()</code> 在 <code>@Before</code> 触发注入；Rule 的 <code>order</code> 必须小于其他 Rule。</li>\n<li><strong>绑定替换的两级手段</strong>：<code>@TestInstallIn</code> 全局替换生产模块，<code>@UninstallModules</code> 只在单个测试类中卸载并以内嵌 Module 提供 Fake。</li>\n<li><strong>测试 Application / Runner</strong>：自定义 <code>AndroidJUnitRunner</code> 配合 <code>HiltTestApplication</code> 初始化测试环境。</li>\n<li><strong>按测试类型选工具</strong>：ViewModel / Repository 单元测试无需 Hilt，直接构造 + Fake 更快更独立；只有 UI 集成与端到端测试才引入 Hilt。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hiltandroidtest\">@HiltAndroidTest</h2><p><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code> 注解标记测试类，使其支持 Hilt 依赖注入。配合 <code>HiltAndroidRule</code> 管理 Hilt 的生命周期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltAndroidTest&#10;@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class UserFlowTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule(order = 0)&#10;    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule(order = 1)&#10;    val composeRule = createAndroidComposeRule&lt;MainActivity&gt;()&#10;&#10;    @Inject&#10;    lateinit var userRepository: UserRepository&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        hiltRule.inject()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun userProfile_displaysCorrectName() {&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;用户名&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltAndroidTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserFlowTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule(order = 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule(order = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createAndroidComposeRule&#x3C;MainActivity>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Inject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lateinit var userRepository: UserRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hiltRule.inject()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun userProfile_displaysCorrectName() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"用户名\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;@HiltAndroidTest&quot;] --&gt; B[HiltAndroidRule]&#10;    B --&gt; C[hiltRule.inject]&#10;    C --&gt; D[注入测试依赖]&#10;    D --&gt; E[运行测试方法]&#10;&#10;    classDef testStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A testStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"@HiltAndroidTest\"] --&gt; B[HiltAndroidRule]\n    B --&gt; C[hiltRule.inject]\n    C --&gt; D[注入测试依赖]\n    D --&gt; E[运行测试方法]\n\n    classDef testStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A testStyle</pre><p>测试配置的关键组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code></td>\n<td>注解测试类</td>\n<td>启用 Hilt 测试支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HiltAndroidRule</code></td>\n<td>JUnit Rule</td>\n<td>管理 Hilt 组件生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hiltRule.inject()</code></td>\n<td>触发注入</td>\n<td>在 <code>@Before</code> 中调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HiltTestApplication</code></td>\n<td>测试 Application</td>\n<td>自动替换生产 Application</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>HiltAndroidRule</code> 的 <code>order</code> 必须小于其他 Rule（如 <code>ComposeTestRule</code>），确保 Hilt 在其他 Rule 之前初始化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试模块\">测试模块</h2><p>使用 <code>@TestInstallIn</code> 全局替换模块，或使用 <code>@UninstallModules</code> 在单个测试类中替换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Module&#10;@TestInstallIn(&#10;    components = [SingletonComponent::class],&#10;    replaces = [NetworkModule::class]&#10;)&#10;object FakeNetworkModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideArticleApi(): ArticleApi {&#10;        return FakeArticleApi()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {&#10;        return OkHttpClient.Builder().build()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class FakeArticleApi : ArticleApi {&#10;&#10;    private val articles = mutableListOf(&#10;        Article(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;测试文章一&quot;, &quot;内容一&quot;),&#10;        Article(&quot;2&quot;, &quot;测试文章二&quot;, &quot;内容二&quot;)&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun getArticles(): List&lt;Article&gt; = articles&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun getArticle(id: String): Article {&#10;        return articles.first { it.id == id }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun addArticle(article: Article) {&#10;        articles.add(article)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@TestInstallIn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    components = [SingletonComponent::class],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    replaces = [NetworkModule::class]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object FakeNetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideArticleApi(): ArticleApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return FakeArticleApi()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return OkHttpClient.Builder().build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class FakeArticleApi : ArticleApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val articles = mutableListOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article(\"1\", \"测试文章一\", \"内容一\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article(\"2\", \"测试文章二\", \"内容二\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getArticles(): List&#x3C;Article> = articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getArticle(id: String): Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return articles.first { it.id == id }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun addArticle(article: Article) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        articles.add(article)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>@TestInstallIn</code> vs <code>@UninstallModules</code> 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>@TestInstallIn</th>\n<th>@UninstallModules</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用范围</td>\n<td>所有测试类</td>\n<td>单个测试类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置</td>\n<td>Module 上</td>\n<td>测试类上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>全局替换依赖</td>\n<td>单测试替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>低（全局统一）</td>\n<td>高（逐测试定制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"卸载模块\">卸载模块</h2><p><code>@UninstallModules</code> 在单个测试类中卸载生产模块，然后通过内嵌模块提供替代实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltAndroidTest&#10;@UninstallModules(RepositoryModule::class)&#10;@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class ArticleListScreenTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule(order = 0)&#10;    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule(order = 1)&#10;    val composeRule = createAndroidComposeRule&lt;MainActivity&gt;()&#10;&#10;    @Module&#10;    @InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;    object TestRepositoryModule {&#10;&#10;        @Provides&#10;        @Singleton&#10;        fun provideArticleRepository(): ArticleRepository {&#10;            return FakeArticleRepository().apply {&#10;                setArticles(&#10;                    listOf(&#10;                        Article(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Kotlin 协程指南&quot;, &quot;详细的协程教程...&quot;),&#10;                        Article(&quot;2&quot;, &quot;Compose 最佳实践&quot;, &quot;Compose 开发技巧...&quot;)&#10;                    )&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        hiltRule.inject()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun articleList_displaysAllArticles() {&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Kotlin 协程指南&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Compose 最佳实践&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun articleList_showsEmptyState_whenNoArticles() {&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;暂无文章&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltAndroidTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@UninstallModules(RepositoryModule::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleListScreenTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule(order = 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule(order = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createAndroidComposeRule&#x3C;MainActivity>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    object TestRepositoryModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun provideArticleRepository(): ArticleRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return FakeArticleRepository().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                setArticles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Article(\"1\", \"Kotlin 协程指南\", \"详细的协程教程...\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Article(\"2\", \"Compose 最佳实践\", \"Compose 开发技巧...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hiltRule.inject()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun articleList_displaysAllArticles() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Kotlin 协程指南\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Compose 最佳实践\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun articleList_showsEmptyState_whenNoArticles() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"暂无文章\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant 测试类&#10;    participant Hilt&#10;    participant 生产Module&#10;    participant 测试Module&#10;&#10;    测试类-&gt;&gt;Hilt: @UninstallModules(RepositoryModule)&#10;    Hilt-&gt;&gt;生产Module: 跳过 RepositoryModule&#10;    测试类-&gt;&gt;Hilt: @InstallIn 内嵌测试 Module&#10;    Hilt-&gt;&gt;测试Module: 安装 TestRepositoryModule&#10;    Hilt-&gt;&gt;测试类: 注入 Fake 依赖&#10;    测试类-&gt;&gt;测试类: 运行测试\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant 测试类\n    participant Hilt\n    participant 生产Module\n    participant 测试Module\n\n    测试类-&gt;&gt;Hilt: @UninstallModules(RepositoryModule)\n    Hilt-&gt;&gt;生产Module: 跳过 RepositoryModule\n    测试类-&gt;&gt;Hilt: @InstallIn 内嵌测试 Module\n    Hilt-&gt;&gt;测试Module: 安装 TestRepositoryModule\n    Hilt-&gt;&gt;测试类: 注入 Fake 依赖\n    测试类-&gt;&gt;测试类: 运行测试</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义测试组件\">自定义测试组件</h2><p>对于复杂的测试场景，可以创建自定义测试 Runner 和 Application。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class CustomTestRunner : AndroidJUnitRunner() {&#10;    override fun newApplication(&#10;        cl: ClassLoader?,&#10;        className: String?,&#10;        context: Context?&#10;    ): Application {&#10;        return super.newApplication(cl, HiltTestApplication::class.java.name, context)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在 build.gradle.kts 中配置&#10;// android {&#10;//     defaultConfig {&#10;//         testInstrumentationRunner = &quot;com.example.app.CustomTestRunner&quot;&#10;//     }&#10;// }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class CustomTestRunner : AndroidJUnitRunner() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun newApplication(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cl: ClassLoader?,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        className: String?,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        context: Context?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): Application {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return super.newApplication(cl, HiltTestApplication::class.java.name, context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 build.gradle.kts 中配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     defaultConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//         testInstrumentationRunner = \"com.example.app.CustomTestRunner\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ViewModel 的单元测试可以不使用 Hilt，直接构造：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleViewModelTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()&#10;&#10;    private lateinit var viewModel: ArticleViewModel&#10;    private val fakeRepository = FakeArticleRepository()&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        viewModel = ArticleViewModel(&#10;            repository = fakeRepository,&#10;            savedStateHandle = SavedStateHandle(mapOf(&quot;articleId&quot; to &quot;1&quot;))&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `loading state is shown initially`() = runTest {&#10;        val state = viewModel.uiState.value&#10;        assertTrue(state.isLoading)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `articles loaded successfully`() = runTest {&#10;        fakeRepository.setArticles(listOf(Article(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;测试&quot;, &quot;内容&quot;)))&#10;&#10;        advanceUntilIdle()&#10;&#10;        val state = viewModel.uiState.value&#10;        assertFalse(state.isLoading)&#10;        assertEquals(1, state.articles.size)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `error state on failure`() = runTest {&#10;        fakeRepository.setShouldFail(true)&#10;&#10;        advanceUntilIdle()&#10;&#10;        val state = viewModel.uiState.value&#10;        assertNotNull(state.error)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class MainDispatcherRule(&#10;    private val dispatcher: TestDispatcher = UnconfinedTestDispatcher()&#10;) : TestWatcher() {&#10;    override fun starting(description: Description) {&#10;        Dispatchers.setMain(dispatcher)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun finished(description: Description) {&#10;        Dispatchers.resetMain()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleViewModelTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var viewModel: ArticleViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeRepository = FakeArticleRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel = ArticleViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository = fakeRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            savedStateHandle = SavedStateHandle(mapOf(\"articleId\" to \"1\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `loading state is shown initially`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val state = viewModel.uiState.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(state.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `articles loaded successfully`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeRepository.setArticles(listOf(Article(\"1\", \"测试\", \"内容\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceUntilIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val state = viewModel.uiState.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertFalse(state.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(1, state.articles.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `error state on failure`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeRepository.setShouldFail(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceUntilIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val state = viewModel.uiState.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertNotNull(state.error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MainDispatcherRule(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dispatcher: TestDispatcher = UnconfinedTestDispatcher()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : TestWatcher() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun starting(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dispatchers.setMain(dispatcher)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun finished(description: Description) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dispatchers.resetMain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>是否需要 Hilt</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ViewModel 单元测试</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>直接构造 + Fake 依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repository 单元测试</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>直接构造 + Fake</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 集成测试</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端测试</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code> + <code>@UninstallModules</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 优先在单元测试中直接构造对象而非使用 Hilt，这样测试更快、更独立。仅在集成测试和 UI 测试中使用 Hilt。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>@HiltAndroidTest</code> + <code>HiltAndroidRule</code> 是 Hilt 测试的基础配置</li>\n<li><code>@TestInstallIn</code> 全局替换模块，<code>@UninstallModules</code> 在单个测试类中替换</li>\n<li>内嵌的 <code>@Module</code> 提供测试专用的 Fake 实现</li>\n<li>自定义 <code>AndroidJUnitRunner</code> 配合 <code>HiltTestApplication</code> 初始化测试环境</li>\n<li>ViewModel 和 Repository 的单元测试不需要 Hilt，直接构造更简洁高效</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hilt 测试","id":"hilt-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@HiltAndroidTest","id":"hiltandroidtest"},{"level":2,"text":"测试模块","id":"测试模块"},{"level":2,"text":"卸载模块","id":"卸载模块"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义测试组件","id":"自定义测试组件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"作用域与绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/scopes-and-bindings"},"next":{"title":"Koin 替代方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/koin-alternative"}}